Corrected message:

Test undo/redo of edits to existing modifier nodes

Adds a history scenario suite that edits nodes already on the layer:
strength, blend mode, name and visibility changes, re-applying an
effect with new settings (including while hidden), reordering objects
and nodes, moving a layer, and a final bake. The session is undone and
redone linearly, out of order, and in long runs, with targeted tests
for a reorder between a property edit and its undo and for unhiding a
node edited while hidden.
